extraStrings:
- type: en-US
  strings:
    STR_AF_TITLE: INTERCEPT
    STR_AF_FIGHT: FIGHT
    STR_AF_AUTO_RESOLVE: AUTO-RESOLVE
    STR_AF_VERSUS: against {0}
    STR_AF_ODDS_LATER: 'Odds: not worked out yet.'
    STR_AF_TOO_DAMAGED: Too badly damaged to attack
    STR_AF_DECK_OUT_OF_REACH: More than one deck away
    STR_AF_OUT_OF_ARC: 'Not in the gun''s arc: turn to face it'
    STR_AF_LOST_EJECTED: LOST. {0} ejected and will be back hurt.
    STR_AF_LOST_PILOT_KILLED: LOST, with {0}.
    STR_AF_CRAFT_HEALTH: '{0}% intact'
    STR_AF_UFO_DOWN: '{0} SHOT DOWN'
    STR_AF_UFO_THROUGH: '{0} GOT AWAY'
    STR_AF_UFO_BROKE_OFF: '{0} broke off'
    STR_AF_BRIEFING_TITLE: AIR FIGHT
    STR_AF_BRIEFING: 'Floor 0 is the ground; floors 1 to 4 are the decks, low to high (Page Up / Page Down).{NEWLINE}Guns fire FORWARD ONLY: the target must be in the 90-degree cone ahead of the nose, on the same deck or one up or down. Firing does not turn you - turn first.{NEWLINE}Hit chance is best from behind (+20) and worst head-on (-10), and falls off past 3 tiles.{NEWLINE}An aircraft that ends its turn on the edge of the map leaves the fight. A Cobra plane that reaches its exit edge gets away. 12 rounds, then everyone goes home.'
    STR_AF_SKYSTRIKER: Skystriker
    STR_AF_CONQUEST: Conquest X-30
    STR_AF_PHANTOM: Phantom X-19
    STR_AF_RATTLER: Rattler
    STR_AF_FIREBAT: Firebat
    STR_AF_NIGHT_RAVEN: Night Raven
    STR_AF_CARTEL_PLANE: Cartel smuggler
